{"id": "DddcJZKTIhf", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Why does Maa Kali always have her tongue out? 👅\nMost of us grew up seeing the fierce avatar of Goddess Kali, but do you know the beautiful meaning behind this iconic image? When her fierce anger threatened to consume the universe, Lord Shiva lay peacefully in her path. The moment her foot touched him, his pure calmness instantly dissolved her rage.\nThis is one of the most powerful Hindu mythology stories to teach kids about anger management. It shows our little ones that even the biggest, most uncontrollable anger can be stopped by peace and love. Indian mythology isn’t just about battles; it’s packed with gentle, valuable life lessons for modern Indian parenting!\nAs we gear up for Navratri, we are bringing these magical tales to life.\n👉 Follow @therishikatha for more animated mythological bedtime stories for kids and get early access to our upcoming Navadurga storybook series!\n✨ Drop a ❤️ if you want your kids to grow up with these powerful Indian stories!#sanatandharma #mahadev #ganeshchaturthi #mataparvati #kali", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1789801775, "like_count": 57, "comment_count": 3, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1101404359490755a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 62.846, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMDYG0_yfbBzGnEhAWj4ZBO_zmPG1sA6ybZm_m7C7R2F6OZy-sRq2RwYM7oBtJs10Mh60yo2TXmfFGB6mvbef-v36VhLl5lDullr3g.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Adr4Hz_XJBkK82RukhsJ4QiSO3QED